      "statistics_summary": "Each series covers 2000-01 to 2024-12. The seasonal cycle was removed, then a least-squares fit gave each rate per decade and its 95% interval. Fits on annual anomalies, a robust fit, a rerun without the most extreme month and a Theil-Sen fit with a Mann-Kendall test checked that result. The fits were corrected for month-to-month autocorrelation and, because 71 series were tested, for false discoveries at a rate of 0.05. Together these give the Evidence label: Not enough evidence yet.",
